    "keeps_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "what-keeps",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-pepper {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 300px);\n    gap: 34px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__rows {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 15px 17px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n    gap: 10px 16px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__name {\n    grid-column: 1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__tag {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: var(--gold);\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__meter {\n    grid-column: 2;\n    grid-row: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 4px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip {\n    width: 9px;\n    height: 9px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d8cfc0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip.is-on {\n    background: #b8462f;\n    border-color: #b8462f;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__note {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__legend {\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__cap {\n    margin: 10px 0 0;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 989px) {\n    .sea-pepper {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__figure {\n      order: -1;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"sea-pepper\">\n  <div class=\"sea-pepper__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"sea-pepper__body\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__eyebrow\">Make it ahead, but know the limits</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sea-pepper__heading\">The farro salad is what keeps. The fish is what sets the clock.</h2>\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__lede\">\n        This dish genuinely improves overnight and is as good at room temperature as it is warm\n        &mdash; but that is true of the grain, the mushrooms and the dressing, not of the branzino.\n        Cooked fish is a three-to-four day ingredient however well you store it, so the parts want\n        keeping separately and combining late.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__rows\">\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row sea-pepper__row--pick\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Farro base, through the dressing</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Best</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Keeps: 5 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Farro, maitake, onion and the miso-lemon dressing, refrigerated airtight. Four days, and it is better on day two than on day one.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Toasted hazelnuts, separate</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Keeps: 5 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Airtight at room temperature, two weeks. Toast the whole &#8531; cup even if you are halving the dish &mdash; they keep far longer than anything else here.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Cooked branzino, kept apart</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Keeps: 3 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Three days refrigerated, skin removed. The skin will not crisp back once it has been chilled, so there is nothing lost by taking it off first.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Everything folded together</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Keeps: 3 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Three days, and the fish is what caps it &mdash; not the salad. Chop the fish into bite-sized pieces and fold it through for a one-container lunch.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Pear, parsley and nuts, folded in</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Hold back</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Keeps: 2 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">One to two days at the outside. Pear browns even with lemon on it, parsley goes limp and the hazelnuts soften. Add all three at the table instead.</p>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__legend\">\n        Ratings are how well each part survives the refrigerator, not a safety rating. The three-to\n        four-day limit on cooked fish is the one to keep &mdash; it is shorter than the salad, and it\n        is what the whole dish is bound by once they are mixed.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"sea-pepper__figure\">\n      <img\n        src=\"{{ '20260825-Stetten-Wilson-224.jpg' | file_url }}\"\n        alt=\"The warm farro and maitake salad in a bowl beside the skillet\"\n        width=\"1200\"\n        height=\"800\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\">\n      <figcaption class=\"sea-pepper__cap\">\n        Stop here to make it ahead &mdash; dressed farro and mushrooms, with the pear, parsley and\n        hazelnuts still to come.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 16,
        "divider": false,
        "narrow": false,
        "rounded": false,
        "color_text": "",
        "color_background": "",
