        "rounded": false,
        "heading_size": "title-md",
        "heading_alignment": "text-left md:items-end md:flex-row",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>The structure is what matters &mdash; a chewy grain, a browned mushroom, something crisp and sweet, a toasted nut, and a salty-sour dressing added off the heat. Each of those has more than one answer.</p>",
        "heading": "Swaps that work",
