    "rich_text_standard": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "f_sub": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "The fish under the spice",
            "subheading_size": "subtitle-md",
            "secondary_color": true
          }
        },
        "f_head": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why branzino takes to this",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "f_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Branzino is lean and mild where the farro salad is rich and savoury, which is the whole balance of the plate &mdash; a fattier fish would compete with the miso and the browned mushrooms rather than cut through them. The thin fillet is also what makes the crisp skin possible in four minutes. Sashimi-grade, blast-frozen to &minus;10&deg;F at harvest and vacuum sealed, so it comes out of the freezer ready to take a hard sear.</p><p>Every supplier is tested before we approve them, then randomly audited to ensure consistent compliance with the Seatopia Standard &mdash; third-party lab tested for nutrition, mercury and microplastics, and sourced from best-in-class aquaculture. <a href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/best-ways-to-defrost-sushi-grade-seafood-for-sashimi-and-cooking\">How to defrost sushi-grade seafood</a> if you are starting from frozen.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "f_btn": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "How we source it",
            "button_link": "/pages/why-clean-seafood-matters",
            "button_style": "secondary",
            "button_size": "md",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "f_sub",
